{
  "about": "The moving card box (fullscreen-player.md §14.10): in Max, Now Playing goes between its resting box in column 1 and the full one as an empty card box that moves and changes size, with the card rim, corners, shadow and album glow; the resting place is filled by a bare still cut where the box covers it. Open and close in five skins on the dev app; the probes check that nothing is left (no box, no still) and the real card is visible after each. The first shot remembers the skin and the last puts it back.",
  "desk_test": "features/fullscreen-player.md §14.10",
  "made": "2026-10-19",
  "pass": "Each probe expect holds. In the strips: the close is the card shrinking into its own place (no cut edge crossing the cards, no gray square past the box), the open is the reverse, and the rows come in after the box lands.",
  "run": "node scripts/shots.mjs --list docs/ops/checks/fp-move.json   (needs npm run dev:app running in Max; not stacked unless the window is taller than wide)",
  "shots": [
    {
      "id": "fp-move-glass",
      "kind": "clip",
      "source": "dev",
      "seconds": 5,
      "steps": [
        {
          "eval": "window.__fpMoveSkin = window.__store.get(\"skin\")"
        },
        {
          "eval": "window.__store.set(\"skin\",\"glass\")"
        },
        {
          "wait": 1800
        },
        {
          "probe": "JSON.stringify(window.__full.state())",
          "expect": {
            "full": false
          },
          "name": "rest"
        },
        {
          "click": ".grow-zone[data-player-side=\"right\"]:not([hidden])",
          "frames": 40
        },
        {
          "wait": 1600
        },
        {
          "probe": "JSON.stringify({full: window.__full.state().full, ghosts: document.querySelectorAll(\".fp-ghost\").length, stills: document.querySelectorAll(\".np-still\").length, op: getComputedStyle(document.querySelector(\".panel[data-slot=np]\")).opacity})",
          "expect": {
            "full": true,
            "ghosts": 0,
            "stills": 0,
            "op": "1"
          },
          "name": "open"
        },
        {
          "click": ".grow-zone[data-act=\"collapse\"]:not([hidden])",
          "frames": 40
        },
        {
          "wait": 1400
        },
        {
          "probe": "JSON.stringify({full: window.__full.state().full, ghosts: document.querySelectorAll(\".fp-ghost\").length, stills: document.querySelectorAll(\".np-still\").length, op: getComputedStyle(document.querySelector(\".panel[data-slot=np]\")).opacity})",
          "expect": {
            "full": false,
            "ghosts": 0,
            "stills": 0,
            "op": "1"
          },
          "name": "closed"
        }
      ],
      "covers": "features/fullscreen-player.md"
    },
